{"id":"n38232-1-8","stage":3,"title":"꽃무늬 · 花纹","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n38232-1-8-1","ko":"이 둘 중에 어떤 원피스가 더 나아?","zh":"这两件里，哪件连衣裙更好看些？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"둘","meaning":"二","explanation":"둘：二","readings":[{"term":"둘","audio":"/audio/ca76b1284fc2088d64d7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"34869","senseId":"1","lemma":"둘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"둘","audio":"/audio/ca76b1284fc2088d64d7.mp3"}},{"text":"중에","meaning":"当中","explanation":"중：当中；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"중","audio":"/audio/b558d7af71515538c58a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79404","senseId":"1","lemma":"중","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"중에","audio":"/audio/f0d257645978930f07ec.mp3"}},{"text":"어떤","meaning":"哪一个","explanation":"어떤：哪一个","readings":[{"term":"어떤","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17185","senseId":"2","lemma":"어떤","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어떤","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3"}},{"text":"원피스가","meaning":"连衣裙","explanation":"원피스：连衣裙；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"원피스","audio":"/audio/3d8a55e85748680559d0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26721","senseId":"1","lemma":"원피스","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"원피스가","audio":"/audio/2369f676ef712c392bf7.mp3"}},{"text":"더","meaning":"更，更加","explanation":"더：更，更加","readings":[{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26829","senseId":"2","lemma":"더","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}},{"text":"나아?","meaning":"更好，胜过","explanation":"낫다：更好，胜过；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"낫다","audio":"/audio/fde5eb6648ee9db93798.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"38524","senseId":"1","lemma":"낫다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나아","audio":"/audio/c9a957077720bbde1661.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"27527","definition":"指代离说话人较近的，或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"ca76b1284fc2088d","term":"둘","zh":"二","audio":"/audio/ca76b1284fc2088d64d7.mp3","entryId":"34869","definition":"一加一后所得的数目。","pronunciation":["둘ː"]},{"id":"b558d7af71515538","term":"중","zh":"当中","audio":"/audio/b558d7af71515538c58a.mp3","entryId":"79404","definition":"多个中。","pronunciation":["중"]},{"id":"a0307911a0fb4256","term":"어떤","zh":"哪一个","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3","entryId":"17185","definition":"用于询问在现有的多个人或事物中，作为对象的是什么。","pronunciation":["어떤"]},{"id":"3d8a55e857486805","term":"원피스","zh":"连衣裙","audio":"/audio/3d8a55e85748680559d0.mp3","entryId":"26721","definition":"上衣和裙子一体的女性衣服。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"1e2cb79b6970d021","term":"더","zh":"更，更加","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3","entryId":"26829","definition":"与比较对象或某个标准相比，程度加深；在那之上。","pronunciation":["더"]},{"id":"fde5eb6648ee9db9","term":"낫다","zh":"更好，胜过","audio":"/audio/fde5eb6648ee9db93798.mp3","entryId":"38524","definition":"相比之下，比别的好。","pronunciation":["낟ː따"]}],"audio":"/audio/4515487103f2e449fb7e.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n38232-1-8-2","ko":"봄이니까 화사하게 꽃무늬로 하는 게 어때?","zh":"现在是春天，选件色彩鲜艳、有花图案的怎么样？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"봄이니까","meaning":"春，春天，春季","explanation":"봄：春，春天，春季；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；니까：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"봄","audio":"/audio/c3756af91340d5ce8345.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20219","senseId":"1","lemma":"봄","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"봄이니까","audio":"/audio/96c98a4348d8957338e8.mp3"}},{"text":"화사하게","meaning":"明媚，华丽","explanation":"화사하다：明媚，华丽；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"화사하다","audio":"/audio/5bbdcb1b42824ede7a22.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88009","senseId":"1","lemma":"화사하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"화사하게","audio":"/audio/4db45e1677bf5246761a.mp3"}},{"text":"꽃무늬로","meaning":"花纹","explanation":"꽃무늬：花纹；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"꽃무늬","audio":"/audio/b48618b67ff0eafd3d55.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"38232","senseId":"1","lemma":"꽃무늬","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"꽃무늬로","audio":"/audio/d1e6c6a1b12f8d18a93d.mp3"}},{"text":"하는","meaning":"做，作，置办","explanation":"하다：做，作，置办；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"2","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하는","audio":"/audio/db405bc1ba8346522533.mp3"}},{"text":"게","meaning":"这件事、这种情况（것 + 이）","explanation":"게 是依存名词 것 和主格助词 이 的缩合，指前面修饰的事物、行为或情况，并把它作为主语；这里不是表示将来计划的 -ㄹ/을 것이다。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"게","audio":"/audio/c7150cec89b60925ae40.mp3"}},{"text":"어때?","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어때","audio":"/audio/b8638c1eedbc8ab7e09d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c3756af91340d5ce","term":"봄","zh":"春，春天，春季","audio":"/audio/c3756af91340d5ce8345.mp3","entryId":"20219","definition":"四季之一，在冬天与夏天之间。","pronunciation":["봄"]},{"id":"5bbdcb1b42824ede","term":"화사하다","zh":"明媚，华丽","audio":"/audio/5bbdcb1b42824ede7a22.mp3","entryId":"88009","definition":"明亮美丽。","pronunciation":["화사하다"]},{"id":"b48618b67ff0eafd","term":"꽃무늬","zh":"花纹","audio":"/audio/b48618b67ff0eafd3d55.mp3","entryId":"38232","definition":"花形状的纹路。","pronunciation":["꼰무니"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，作，置办","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"制作或准备什么东西。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"前面所说的行为、状态或事情","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"前面所说的行为、状态或事情","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]}],"audio":"/audio/9b87aebcb430c0e43bef.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.985,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=38232","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":99,"sequenceScore":2.6384,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["这两件里，哪件连衣裙更好看些？","现在是春天，选件色彩鲜艳、有花图案的怎么样？","请问作家最近在创作什么作品呢？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["这两件里，哪件连衣裙更好看些？","现在是春天，选件色彩鲜艳、有花图案的怎么样？","请问作家最近在创作什么作品呢？"],"answer":1}]}
